{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1550915-advice-on-a-antagonist-group-freedom-now","id":1550915,"title":"Advice on a antagonist group: Freedom Now!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-05-10T13:26:16-07:00","id":1550915,"title":"Advice on a antagonist group: Freedom Now!","content":"I have an interesting concept for a Werewolf game brewing in my head set during the beginning phases of what might be the actual Garou Apocalypse. Civilization hasn't collapsed yet, but more and more Fomori and other Wyrm monsters are pouring out of Malfeas and wherever else and becoming more visible, especially after a incident where Fomori destroyed a entire Midwestern town, which the government blamed on a unknown virus, reframing the Fomori as a new viral infection. <br /> To make a long story short a good portion of the United States is now under &quot;occupation&quot; by a government backed paramilitary force called SHAMP, or the Strategic Homeland Anomalus Management Program, a organization consisted of PMCs and security agencies. Their main focus is to help the strained government contain the chaos a quickly rupturing Veil is causing, but the agency is quickly going more and more Orwellian in its methods, especially in cities it's occupying.<br /> <br /> Freedom Now is one of the many &quot;resistance movements&quot; founded to counteract SHAMP, and the most notorious. My idea is that Freedom Now! Was founded with the same tactics used to create F.E.A.R. and may even be a merger of the eco terrorist group with another group by Simon Bittergrin and another BSD.<br /> <br /> Can I have advice on how to make this antagonist interesting and insight on how BSD backed freedom fighters would act.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-10T16:29:35-07:00","id":1550920,"title":"","content":"OK, so, I feel like this is a situation where you need to think a bit less about world building and a bit more about how this would work in-play. The BSDs are basically taking the spot you'd expect the PCs to want to occupy as Garou: the freedom fighters against corrupt and oppressive government action. Esp. since you made the hair product (sorry, but SHAMPoo is kinda hard to take seriously) totalitarians urban focused, most Garou are going to see the Wyrm and Weaver fighting over urban areas and let them duke it out so the PCs can go focus on reducing the flow of Wyrm servants into the physical realm. It doesn't matter how interesting you make Freedom Now! if the PCs have no reason to care about their details. Either the Weaver takes them out, and good riddance to the Wyrm tainted terrorists, or the Garou can come back after some time and use the constant fighting against the Weaver's order to strike the weakened Wyrm forces and install Gaian aligned resistance movements instead.<br /> <br /> So I think you're going to need to come up with some adjustments to the initial premise where the PCs have a stronger reason to want to care about Freedom Now!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-10T16:39:16-07:00","id":1550921,"title":"","content":"Good point in that one and I admit I got the SHAMP acronym from CHATGPT, should of chosen a better sounding acronym for the totalitarians.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}